---
import Icon from '@/components/Icon.astro';
import { visitorServices } from '@/data/site';
---

<section id="services" class="section-pad bg-cream-50">
  <div class="container-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">VISITOR SERVICES</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">訪客服務與周邊設施</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-lead lg:justify-self-end">
        出發前先掌握園區與復興區常見的設施類型，把「要不要帶傘、在哪補給、車停哪」一次想好。以下僅列出常見類型，不推薦特定商家。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {visitorServices.map((service) => (
        <article class="detail-card reveal">
          <span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-forest-100 text-forest-700">
            <Icon name={service.icon} class="size-6" />
          </span>
          <div class="mt-5 flex items-baseline gap-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-forest-900">{service.title}</h3>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-plum-100/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-plum-600">{service.type}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-stonewarm-700">{service.body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-forest-900/10 bg-cream-100 p-5 text-sm leading-7 text-stonewarm-700">
      <span class="font-bold text-forest-900">中立客觀說明：</span>本站為非營利科普網站，僅整理遊客常關心的設施類型供規劃參考，不推薦、不代言任何特定商家；實際營業狀態、價格與有無，請以現場與官方公告為準。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
